              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ijaikini ŋes kakonyen nuka EJAKAIT, ituluci ŋin; italaunitai kotoma alele naka aokotoke. Ŋol ŋes ekisil loka ŋin naidouni, arai yenikiliokit arai yeniberu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
